---
import HeroGraph from './HeroGraph.astro';
---
<section class="s" id="how">
  <header class="sh">
    <p class="eyebrow">Under the hood</p>
    <h2>How this site answers</h2>
  </header>
  <p class="how-copy reveal">
    The chat above is not an LLM. A router picks a tool, the tool retrieves from this site's published content, and a verifier checks every number in the answer before it is shown.
  </p>
  <div class="how-graph reveal"><HeroGraph /></div>
  <p class="how-link"><a href="/terminal">Watch it work in the full terminal →</a></p>
</section>
